---
const githubUrl = "https://github.com/vignesh-chaturvedi/divergence";
---

<footer class="site-footer">
  <div class="container site-footer__cta">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">Precision before coverage</p>
      <h2>Scan the contradiction, not the capability.</h2>
      <p>Run the release candidate from source, inspect the evidence, and challenge the labels.</p>
    </div>
    <a class="button button--primary" href="#quickstart">Run the first scan <span aria-hidden="true">↑</span></a>
  </div>

  <div class="container site-footer__grid">
    <a class="brand brand--footer" href="#top" aria-label="Divergence home">
      <img src="/brand/divergence-mark.svg" alt="" width="40" height="40" data-brand-mark />
      <span class="brand__word">divergence</span>
    </a>
    <p>
      Precision-first analysis for MCP servers and agent skills. Apache-2.0 licensed.
    </p>
    <nav aria-label="Footer navigation">
      <a href={githubUrl}>GitHub</a>
      <a href={`${githubUrl}/tree/main/benchmarks/v1.1`}>Evidence</a>
      <a href={`${githubUrl}/blob/main/docs/WRITEUP.md`}>Writeup</a>
      <a href={`${githubUrl}/blob/main/SECURITY.md`}>Security</a>
    </nav>
  </div>

  <div class="container site-footer__bottom">
    <span>© 2026 Vignesh Chaturvedi</span>
    <span>Built for evidence-led review.</span>
  </div>
</footer>
